#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit Addons {#qiskit-addons}"
msgstr "Qiskit Addons {#qiskit-addons}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Qiskit Addons](https://github.com/Qiskit?q=qiskit-addon) are official "
"extension packages that provide specialized quantum computing algorithms and"
" techniques. Each addon focuses on a specific area and includes tutorials "
"with executable code.\n"
msgstr ""
"I [Qiskit Addons](https://github.com/Qiskit?q=qiskit-addon) sono pacchetti "
"di estensione ufficiali che forniscono algoritmi e tecniche di quantum "
"computing specializzati. Ogni addon si concentra su un'area specifica e "
"include tutorial con codice eseguibile.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Available Addons {#available-addons}"
msgstr "Addon Disponibili {#available-addons}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Addon | Package | Description |\n"
"|-------|---------|-------------|\n"
"| **Circuit Cutting** | `qiskit-addon-cutting` | Reduce circuit width and depth by cutting gates and wires |\n"
"| **SQD** | `qiskit-addon-sqd` | Sample-based Quantum Diagonalization for ground state estimation |\n"
"| **OBP** | `qiskit-addon-obp` | Operator Back-Propagation to reduce circuit depth |\n"
"| **MPF** | `qiskit-addon-mpf` | Multi-Product Formulas for improved Hamiltonian simulation |\n"
"| **AQC-Tensor** | `qiskit-addon-aqc-tensor` | Approximate Quantum Compilation with tensor networks |\n"
"| **PNA** | `qiskit-addon-pna` | Propagated Noise Absorption for error mitigation |\n"
"| **SLC** | `qiskit-addon-slc` | Shaded Lightcones for reducing PEC sampling overhead |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Addon | Pacchetto | Descrizione |\n"
"|-------|---------|-------------|\n"
"| **Circuit Cutting** | `qiskit-addon-cutting` | Riduci la larghezza e la profondità del circuito tagliando gate e fili |\n"
"| **SQD** | `qiskit-addon-sqd` | Sample-based Quantum Diagonalization per la stima dello stato fondamentale |\n"
"| **OBP** | `qiskit-addon-obp` | Operator Back-Propagation per ridurre la profondità del circuito |\n"
"| **MPF** | `qiskit-addon-mpf` | Multi-Product Formulas per una simulazione hamiltoniana migliorata |\n"
"| **AQC-Tensor** | `qiskit-addon-aqc-tensor` | Approximate Quantum Compilation con reti tensoriali |\n"
"| **PNA** | `qiskit-addon-pna` | Propagated Noise Absorption per la mitigazione degli errori |\n"
"| **SLC** | `qiskit-addon-slc` | Shaded Lightcones per ridurre l'overhead di campionamento PEC |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"All tutorials can be executed directly in your browser using Binder, or on "
"your own Jupyter server.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tutti i tutorial possono essere eseguiti direttamente nel tuo browser usando"
" Binder, oppure sul tuo server Jupyter personale.\n"

